#: src/Mcp/Catalog.php:162
msgid "Go through the orders that are paid but not shipped yet. For each one tell me whether a shipment has been created, and if not create it. Then tell me which ones are ready for their labels to be printed. Use list-orders, list-shipments and create-shipment. Do not print anything without asking me first."
