#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:150
msgid "Return order counts: either the number of orders in every status, or the count for one status. Common status slugs: processing, pending, on-hold, completed, cancelled, refunded. Use all (or omit status) to get the breakdown across every status. For an actual list of orders use list-orders instead; to find one customer's orders use find-customer-orders. Read-only."
msgstr ""

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:157
msgid "A WooCommerce order status slug. Use all for the breakdown across every status, or name one such as processing, pending, completed, cancelled or refunded"
