msgid "Change order status"
msgstr ""

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:194
msgid "Move an order to a new status such as processing, completed or cancelled. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes the change, and nothing happens until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself."
