msgid "Print shipping labels"
msgstr ""

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1384
msgid "Print shipping labels for one or more orders, grouped automatically by carrier. Calling the tool only proposes it; the print page opens once the user presses Confirm. An order needs an existing shipment before it has a label to print."
msgstr ""

#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1392
msgid "An array of order numbers to print, for example [\"2867\",\"2664\"]"
