#: src/Modules/OrderLookup/Ability.php:1517
msgid "Move several orders to the same new status at once, such as processing, completed or cancelled. This is a destructive action — calling the tool only proposes the change, and nothing happens until the user presses Confirm, so there is no need to ask for confirmation yourself. Use this whenever the user mentions two or more orders together."
