#: src/Modules/Shipping/Methods/AbstractShippingMethod.php:96
msgid "Off by default: the cost formula is evaluated once for the whole cart and the entire shipping cost goes onto the first shipment, so with cash on delivery the first parcel collects all of it. When on, the cost formula is evaluated separately for the items in each temperature zone. The cost the customer sees at checkout is the sum of every zone, so a multi-zone order pays the base rate more than once, and each shipment carries the amount worked out for its own zone. You also need a cost formula such as `[moksafowo_addfee cool_2=\"X\" cool_3=\"Y\"]` for the zones to produce different amounts."
